  era: "Neolithic \xB7 Section 1 \xB7 Prehistoric India \xB7 c. 1.5 million years ago \u2013 700 BCE"
  title: Neolithic pottery
  text: Pottery appeared during the Neolithic, first made by hand and later turned on a slow wheel. It let people store grain, cook food and carry water. Different shapes, colours and decorations help archaeologists identify and date cultures.
